MANUSCRIPT SUMMARY — Claude reference file
Source: "Manuscript" (~62,900 words). Covers the opening through Seventh Day evening of Dusty's first week (Valia's lab, Maedelyn's first tutoring session, Rariel's lunch ultimatum over Auriel, Dusty finding Auriel on the north shore, their visit to Rinnie in Aethres, the swimming lesson, the attack on the lake path, and Dusty waking in the Solarium ward).
Scene breaks in the manuscript are marked ***. POV is third limited; the POV character is noted per scene.

